k-muted">fonte · edital · item 3.2.1</p><div class="mt-3"><div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2" data-testid="approval-diff"><div class="k-card-soft p-3 bg-[#fff0ee] text-[#c94f45] dark:bg-[#30201f] dark:text-[#ff907d]"><p class="k-eyebrow mb-2">antes</p><dl class="space-y-1"><div class="flex gap-2 text-[11px] leading-5"><dt class="k-mono shrink-0 opacity-70">canonicalName</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-words">Nova Lei de Licitações</dd></div><div class="flex gap-2 text-[11px] leading-5"><dt class="k-mono shrink-0 opacity-70">status</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-words">provisional</dd></div></dl></div><div class="k-card-soft p-3 bg-[#edf8ef] text-[#23824d] dark:bg-[#172c26] dark:text-[#80d8a5]"><p class="k-eyebrow mb-2">proposta</p><dl class="space-y-1"><div class="flex gap-2 text-[11px] leading-5"><dt class="k-mono shrink-0 opacity-70">canonicalName</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-words">Lei nº 14.133/2021</dd></div><div class="flex gap-2 text-[11px] leading-5"><dt class="k-mono shrink-0 opacity-70">status</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-words">confirmed</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex shrink-0 gap-2 self-start"><button class="k-button k-button-primary whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="button-approve-appr-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> Aprovar</button><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-coral whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="button-reject-appr-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg> Rejeitar</button></div></div></article><article class="k-card p-5" data-testid="card-approval-appr-2"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 md:flex-row"><div class="flex min-w-0 gap-4"><input class="mt-2 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-label="Selecionar &quot;Estrutura do edital identificada — versão 2&quot; para aprovação em lote" data-testid="checkbox-select-appr-2" type="checkbox"><span class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-[#eef5d8] text-[#5f7900] dark:bg-[#202b20] dark:text-[#d5f35b]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-left" data-testid="button-toggle-appr-2" aria-expanded="true"><span class="k-mono k-muted text-[11px]">▾</span><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold">Estrutura do edital identificada — versão 2</p></button><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="k-chip">estrutura do edital</span><span class="k-mono k-muted text-[10px]">confiança · 80%</span></div><p class="mt-3 max-w-[700px] text-[12px] leading-5 k-muted">Extração automática do texto colado na atualização do edital.</p><div class="mt-3"><div class="k-card-soft flex flex-col gap-2 p-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="text-[11px] leading-5 k-muted">Estrutura extraída do edital — revise a árvore completa antes de confirmar.</p><a data-testid="link-review-structure-appr-2" href="/workspace/setec-campinas/edital/revisar/2" class="k-button k-button-quiet self-start whitespace-nowrap">Revisar estrutura</a></div></div></div></div><div class="flex shrink-0 gap-2 self-start"><button class="k-button k-button-primary whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="button-approve-appr-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> Aprovar</button><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-coral whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="button-reject-appr-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg> Rejeitar</button></div></div></article></div><div class="k-card-soft flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert k-coral mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg><p class="text-[11px] leading-5 k-muted">Questões geradas para o diagnóstico inicial não passam por esta fila — aprovar uma a uma bloquearia o primeiro passo do aluno — e continuam rastreáveis fora dela.</p></div></div></div></main></div>"`;

