hield-alert" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg><span>Erros</span></a><a data-testid="link-nav-recomendações" href="/workspace/setec-campinas/recomendacoes" class="k-nav-item "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><span>Recomendações</span></a><a data-testid="link-nav-aprovações" href="/workspace/setec-campinas/aprovacoes" class="k-nav-item k-nav-item-active"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Aprovações</span></a></nav><div class="hidden border-t border-[#242a34] p-4 md:block"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#27352a] text-[10px] font-bold text-[#d5f35b]">Y</span><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold">Yuri</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#8e98a8]">sessão de estudos</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ellipsis ml-auto text-[#8e98a8]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></div><button class="k-button k-button-quiet w-full justify-start px-1 text-[11px]" data-testid="button-settings"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-settings2 lucide-settings-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 17H5"></path><path d="M19 7h-9"></path><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"></circle></svg> Preferências</button></div></aside><main class="k-main min-h-[calc(100dvh-115px)] flex-1 md:ml-[224px] md:min-h-dvh"><header class="flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#242a34] px-5 md:px-9 relative"><div><p class="k-eyebrow mb-1">Aprovações</p><h1 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]">Aprovações</h1></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="relative"><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-icon-button" data-testid="button-practice" aria-label="Registrar prática"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></button></div><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-icon-button" data-testid="button-search" aria-label="Buscar"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></button><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-icon-button" data-testid="button-notifications" aria-label="Notificações"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-dot" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></button><button class="k-button k-button-quiet k-icon-button" data-testid="button-theme-toggle" aria-label="Ativar tema claro" title="Ativar tema claro"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sun" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path></svg></button><span class="mx-1 h-5 w-px bg-[#29313d]"></span><span class="hidden text-right sm:block"><span class="block text-[11px] font-medium">sexta, 12 set</span><span class="k-mono block text-[9px] text-[#8e98a8]">16:20 BRT</span></span></div></header><div class="k-page-enter mx-auto max-w-[1440px] p-5 md:p-9"><div class="k-page-enter space-y-5"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end"><div><p class="k-eyebrow mb-2">fila de aprovação · decisão humana</p><h2 class="text-[27px] font-semibold tracking-[-.05em]">Nada vira conteúdo oficial sem você decidir.</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-[650px] text-[12px] leading-5 k-muted">Estrutura extraída do edital e conceitos fundidos pela IA esperam aqui até que você aprove ou rejeite — nunca entram sozinhos no seu ciclo.</p></div><span class="k-chip k-chip-active">0 aguardando decisão</span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="k-chip cursor-pointer k-chip-active" data-testid="filter-approval-type-todos">todos</button><button class="k-chip cursor-pointer " data-testid="filter-approval-type-edital_structure">estrutura do edital</button><button class="k-chip cursor-pointer " data-testid="filter-approval-type-concept_merge">fusão de conceito</button></div><div class="k-card flex flex-col items-center gap-2 p-12 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert text-[#68788b]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg><p class="text-[13px] font-medium">Nenhuma proposta aguardando decisão</p><p class="text-[11px] k-muted max-w-[420px]">Nada extraído do edital ou fundido pela IA passa a valer sem você aprovar. Questões do diagnóstico inicial são a exceção: não entram nesta fila — travar o primeiro passo do aluno numa aprovação item a item não faria sentido — mas continuam rastreáveis fora dela.</p></div><div class="k-card-soft flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert k-coral mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg><p class="text-[11px] leading-5 k-muted">Questões geradas para o diagnóstico inicial não passam por esta fila — aprovar uma a uma bloquearia o primeiro passo do aluno — e continuam rastreáveis fora dela.</p></div></div></div></main></div>"`;

